WEBVTT

00:02:28.451 --> 00:02:31.553
or a communist dictatorship
of worker bees.

00:02:32.442 --> 00:02:34.785
Other animals, like the social mammals --

00:02:34.809 --> 00:02:38.683
the wolves, the elephants,
the dolphins, the chimpanzees --

00:02:38.707 --> 00:02:41.453
they can cooperate much more flexibly,

00:02:41.477 --> 00:02:44.818
but they do so only in small numbers,

00:02:44.842 --> 00:02:47.715
because cooperation among chimpanzees

00:02:47.739 --> 00:02:51.787
is based on intimate knowledge,
one of the other.

00:02:51.811 --> 00:02:54.579
I'm a chimpanzee and you're a chimpanzee,

00:02:54.603 --> 00:02:56.406
and I want to cooperate with you.

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:59.025
I need to know you personally.

00:02:59.049 --> 00:03:00.819
What kind of chimpanzee are you?